I walk to my bicycle.
My bags are heavy.
My bicycle has a basket.
I pack everything into the basket.
First come the five apples.
And I add the cheese.
Then come the four bread rolls.
They smell so good.
Finally, I take the flowers.
The yellow flowers are beautiful.
They fit perfectly in my flat.
The basket is completely full now.
I take my key.
I unlock the bicycle.
The weather is fantastic.
I ride home comfortably.
I am very hungry now.
A bread roll with cheese is waiting for me.
